==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**5 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

